  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Hybrid Energy Supply</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this project is to turn retrofitting of diesel-powered grids with solar photo voltaic (PV) capacity into a solid business case for private mini grid operators and electricity producing companies (EPC). And thereby provide better access to energy services for small entrepreneurs, Internally Displaced People&apos;s (IDP&#x2019;s) and poorer households. It is a follow-up of a successful hybridization project in Luug that was finalized in 2019 and the intention of East-African Electricity Producing Companies to seriously invest in mini-grids using renewable sources for energy supply.</narrative>
  </description>
